{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3c101133f9d234a8975e3500193db635a0c9ba1de5231d7e7c527b5c92beac4f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce974cc7a6f69c798a1333a12553e29945cc0b998b601cd12752a1b77a0db537",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。现在方便聊几句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bedc39a7b44843c85501b866d2010a614306a1e237171d433fd6243049de042a",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee3a25e8495252c1c089e2efdef9ebec65aa679110261022f95d158f7a99d308",
      "text": "我看到前阵子拍摄的露营地宣传影片\n在街头的大屏幕上播放了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96a30d9d740de7d4fcf0192354b751ec4b239218c337131dc1985d8d585bcade",
      "text": "看到屏幕里的自己笑得比想象中还要开心，\n吓了一跳。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b008e577827c97207cc026c01d474940598e2e8b57c8de3b7c879d7b0f05e13d",
      "text": "我想，这就是我真的很享受那次露营的证明吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6c0fb44f30d74f426e3d6324e6cf6ab87c50c4a7baea2e70387e34e0cf3e887",
      "text": "偶遇的路人也指着屏幕，\n说着“好想去一次看看”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f487c2adee0f12d400937ad03f9ee3a5f8cac11312ea4f367acdd7d43474732",
      "text": "这多亏了听取你的建议，\n把多余的力道卸掉了。那时候真是帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb53740729fca8ed70f268b53aa29431813a4e96656566ffe69c11a708452f1a",
      "text": "这是武先生作为偶像的实力哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6a44a5d2533c0bbf866af01338716e39878bd9828050e306381c7230d456b1f",
      "text": "展现出真实自然的表情非常好",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bfaa3a2c38ef37e46c3cba81593e0f124710af49f154416a16d3f3dc2326b5b",
      "text": "作为偶像的实力……吗。如果努力的方向\n迎来了成果，那我很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfcd2ea09c59e2f7b7e3b5ef7ee54ffa048407d947ccec9a3ec9e0e697009c23",
      "text": "原来有时也会需要我展现出那一面啊。\n作为偶像，我还有太多东西要学了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_402_2_4_038_02_09_a:2_4_038_02_09_a:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f19826518eb1daca3b248929b39720f9bfb24a4e01ed0e34caa9565ab1171a",
      "text": "为了面对任何状况都能应对自如，我想进一步\n磨炼自己的实力。到时候再让我找你商量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
